    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/89aec629fc0a3cde20134a47d8b85366.avif?t=1610863290\" /></div><br>Luxury cars, classy restaurants, marble villas over the ocean and other examples of life's glamor \u2013 your idea of the Mafia probably draws from that pool. Here and now we invite you behind the black curtain that drapes the seedy and dangerous backstage of an underworld as dark as it is alluring.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/2a7e3575f6875b8c6b6e26149c16b946.poster.avif?t=1610863290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/2a7e3575f6875b8c6b6e26149c16b946.webm?t=1610863290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/2a7e3575f6875b8c6b6e26149c16b946.mp4?t=1610863290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You will step into the role of Michael del Conte, a hardened criminal addicted to a few things, including violence. Trailing cigarette smoke and stopping for good whiskey between his acts, he seems every bit the repulsive mobster headed for destruction on the wrong side of the tracks. Experience the horrors of his life and try not to end up one of the victims.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/b4682b362dd6a8e7a06664cb28aa9653.avif?t=1610863290\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tChapter-based non-linear story<br></li><li>\tNumerous cutscenes<br></li><li>\tAllusions to famous moments from classic crime flicks<br></li><li>\tPlenty of black humor and engaging dialogues<br></li><li>\tAttractive, saturated pixel graphics<br></li><li>\tWell-written and original soundtrack in 1960s style</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/927f955486e256cc86b8680652ec37df.poster.avif?t=1610863290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/927f955486e256cc86b8680652ec37df.webm?t=1610863290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/927f955486e256cc86b8680652ec37df.mp4?t=1610863290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/3b8a70e509c154657bb6b267fabdf698.avif?t=1610863290\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tTake part in gory slugfests. Blow out brains and more on a regular basis.<br></li><li>\tEngage in deadly melee. Send those in your way straight down under.<br></li><li>\tKnock out information and confessions \u2013 with your fists or something more fun.<br></li><li>\tObserve, analyze and stay on your toes. What if an old friend should put a revolver to your head?<br></li><li>\tRemain vigilant and make decisions quickly. One second may mean the difference between life and death.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/42437102ee5460698a90511e11eead2e.poster.avif?t=1610863290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/42437102ee5460698a90511e11eead2e.webm?t=1610863290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/42437102ee5460698a90511e11eead2e.mp4?t=1610863290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/89aec629fc0a3cde20134a47d8b85366.avif?t=1610863290\" /></div><br>Luxury cars, classy restaurants, marble villas over the ocean and other examples of life's glamor \u2013 your idea of the Mafia probably draws from that pool. Here and now we invite you behind the black curtain that drapes the seedy and dangerous backstage of an underworld as dark as it is alluring.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/2a7e3575f6875b8c6b6e26149c16b946.poster.avif?t=1610863290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/2a7e3575f6875b8c6b6e26149c16b946.webm?t=1610863290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/2a7e3575f6875b8c6b6e26149c16b946.mp4?t=1610863290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You will step into the role of Michael del Conte, a hardened criminal addicted to a few things, including violence. Trailing cigarette smoke and stopping for good whiskey between his acts, he seems every bit the repulsive mobster headed for destruction on the wrong side of the tracks. Experience the horrors of his life and try not to end up one of the victims.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506490/extras/b4682b362dd6a8e7a06664cb28aa9653.avif?t=1610863290\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tChapter-based non-linear story<br></li><li>\tNumerous cutscenes<br></li><li>\tAllusions to famous moments from classic crime flicks<br></li><li>\tPlenty of black humor and engaging dialogues<br></li><li>\tAttractive, saturated pixel graphics<br></li><li>\tWell-writte